stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> active: request accepted (E27)
  active --> ended: ended early by either party or admin (E32)
  active --> completed: natural conclusion, goal met (E32)
  ended --> [*]
  completed --> [*]
  note right of active
    Sessions can be scheduled only here
  end note
  note right of ended
    Scheduled sessions are cancelled;
    history stays read-only
  end note
